{"2694210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exiled Survivors", "steam_appid": 2694210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the relentless thrill of Exiled Survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced action, shape your destiny with strategic choices, and confront formidable monsters and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 30 characters as you embark on an epic journey through this adrenaline-fueled adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Jump into the action immediately for an adrenaline-pumping gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/5678bcf2ce59172328bcf028b1a13ab6.avif?t=1779447809\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Variety:</strong> Your choices shape the gameplay, even amidst the randomness of each session.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/9176fb07d5ff60ec8f0accdf66a7cbb5.avif?t=1779447809\" width=550 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-Sized Gaming:</strong> Enjoy engaging sessions lasting 15-20 minutes, perfect for casual and intense play.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/620b9865330791a014c642795dada062.avif?t=1779447809\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Challenges:</strong> Confront interesting monsters and formidable bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/e3c1e19c67cf82fdd732e75faa5cb5b5.avif?t=1779447809\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous Progression:</strong> Unlock levels and characters at your own pace, turning every session into a step forward in your gaming journey.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the relentless thrill of Exiled Survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced action, shape your destiny with strategic choices, and confront formidable monsters and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 30 characters as you embark on an epic journey through this adrenaline-fueled adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Jump into the action immediately for an adrenaline-pumping gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/5678bcf2ce59172328bcf028b1a13ab6.avif?t=1779447809\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Variety:</strong> Your choices shape the gameplay, even amidst the randomness of each session.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/9176fb07d5ff60ec8f0accdf66a7cbb5.avif?t=1779447809\" width=550 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-Sized Gaming:</strong> Enjoy engaging sessions lasting 15-20 minutes, perfect for casual and intense play.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694210/extras/620b9865330791a014c642795dada062.avif?t=1779447809\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></li><li><